  "description": "A lightweight, restartable debounce timer for .NET designed for deterministic settlement in UI and event-driven workflows. Cancellation is treated as a normal control path (no TaskCanceledException), and epochs are awaitable for structured async coordination.",
  "id": "IVSoftware.Portable.WatchdogTimer",
